  "limits": [
    "Bounded editor and standalone native qualification on 500 m and 2 km procedural recipes; no new cooked, full-planet production-scale, ACF-specific cave or route-by-route traversal qualification.",
    "Carbonate karst requires a complete finite carbonate palette with positive declared dissolution capability and existing Watershed; selective mixed insoluble beds, evaporite and marble karst remain open.",
    "Neutral province placeholders reconcile after Rock; physical regional forms require separate geology-before-relief ordering.",
    "No groundwater/chemistry simulation, sink/spring discharge transfer, cave water surfaces, speleothem growth or lava-flow history.",
    "Placement uses sampled cover/host checks and conservative support reservations; complete-fit capacity can be below requested compatible-area density.",
    "Native adapter budgets: 16384 candidates, 4096 passages, 2048 chamber lobes and 65536 cubic intervals; complete builds refuse overflow. These are adapter limits, not VPP capability limits.",
    "Pinned exported native nearest-key ABI; platform/plugin upgrades require qualification.",
    "Native field values are not a promise of Euclidean distance to the nearest surface. Sculpting can change magnitudes outside a brush while preserving occupancy and geology. Writer-only control/mining fields in raw cold-reader reports are not performed there; every retained probe is compared instead.",
    "Physical-scale passages may be subpixel in the globe overview; ordinary navigation reveals their surfaces. No size inflation or focus/select behavior is added.",
    "Full native readbacks are test-only; recorded 90-frame navigation performs no input starts or mesh copies."
  ]
